# Backup snapshots taken before edits (AGENTS.md §Бекап перед значною правкою).
# The convention puts them next to the edited file — but this repo is published
# by GitHub Pages, so an untracked .bak sitting in party-game/ or blog/ is one
# `git add -A` away from going live. Ignore them here; they stay on disk as the
# rollback, they just can never be committed.
*.bak-*
